      "content": "but the \"show\" is exhausting. i'm just so tired of pretending that any of this matters. if everything is truly as indifferent and meaningless as it seems, then isn't it kind of a relief to realize that there's no obligation to keep fighting it? like, if the outcome is always nothingness, then stopping the struggle isn't even a tragedy, it's just... logical. isn't it?",
